/T (AFTER \(With Unclutter\)   - Maya now regularly posts items she no longer needs ; it feels easy, not overwhelming   - She has picked up a slow cooker and children's books from neighbours   - Joined a local swap meet through the Community Events tab   - Feels connected to her neighbourhood for the first time since moving   - Her home has less clutter , not because she was told to tidy, but because giving became frictionless )
/E (AFTER \(With Unclutter\)   - Maya now regularly posts items she no longer needs ; it feels easy, not overwhelming   - She has picked up a slow cooker and children's books from neighbours   - Joined a local swap meet through the Community Events tab   - Feels connected to her neighbourhood for the first time since moving   - Her home has less clutter , not because she was told to tidy, but because giving became frictionless )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [3]
>>
