447 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 122 0 R
/T (BEFORE \(Without Unclutter\)   - Closets overflowing with outgrown kids' clothes and unused kitchen gadgets   - Intends to donate "soon" but never finds time ; bags pile up for months   - Tried Facebook Marketplace twice ; felt stressful, impersonal, gave up   - Feels guilt about waste but shame about the mess prevents asking for help   - Items eventually end up in landfill via council hard rubbish collection )
/E (BEFORE \(Without Unclutter\)   - Closets overflowing with outgrown kids' clothes and unused kitchen gadgets   - Intends to donate "soon" but never finds time ; bags pile up for months   - Tried Facebook Marketplace twice ; felt stressful, impersonal, gave up   - Feels guilt about waste but shame about the mess prevents asking for help   - Items eventually end up in landfill via council hard rubbish collection )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
